  "question": {
    "text": "In the following logic circuit the sequence of the inputs <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The output <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math> for this sequence will be :<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1c2281f9-234b-4c86-a7fb-40d7cfd07ae8-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 195px;\" />",
    "image": null
